## Editing your profile

{% steps %}

1. While signed in, click your **avatar** at the top right and choose **Profile**.

2. Click **Edit profile**.

3. Change what you need and click **Update profile** at the bottom of the page.

{% /steps %}

The most common changes:

- **First and last name.** Remember this is the name printed on certificates.
- **Email.** If you change it, you will receive a confirmation email at the new address.
- **User picture.** Upload a photo or avatar; it is cropped to a square automatically.
- **Description.** A short text other students see in the forums.

{% aside type="tip" title="If you signed in with Nostr" %}
Two things specific to Nostr accounts:

- Your **display name** was filled in from your Nostr profile only the first time. If you change it on Nostr, it does not update here; edit it in your campus profile.
- Your **email** is a placeholder address generated from your `npub`, so you receive no mail at all. To receive it, replace it here with your real address. We explain it in [Sign in with Nostr](/en/acceso/login-nostr/#you-will-not-receive-any-email).
{% /aside %}

## Changing the language

The campus is available in Spanish and English.

- **For this session only:** use the language picker in the top menu.
- **Permanently:** avatar → **Preferences** → **Preferred language**.

The interface language does not change the language of course content, which each teacher decides.

## Notifications

Avatar → **Preferences** → **Notification preferences**. There you choose which notices you want by email and which only inside the campus.
